">I've </span><span begin="01:31.063" end="01:31.415">been </span><span begin="01:31.415" end="01:31.983">waiting </span><span begin="01:32.326" end="01:32.591">for </span><span begin="01:32.591" end="01:32.823">you </span><span begin="01:32.823" end="01:33.159">to </span><span begin="01:33.159" end="01:33.448">come </span><span begin="01:33.448" end="01:33.623">back</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.070" end="01:35.454"><span begin="01:34.070" end="01:34.375">Should </span><span begin="01:34.375" end="01:34.663">not </span><span begin="01:34.663" end="01:34.991">have </span><span begin="01:34.991" end="01:35.295">done </span><span begin="01:35.295" end="01:35.454">that</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.647" end="01:36.599"><span begin="01:35.647" end="01:35.871">Now </span><span begin="01:35.871" end="01:36.182">you're </span><span begin="01:36.182" end="01:36.406">gone </span><span begin="01:36.406" end="01:36.599">now</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.063" end="01:38.398"><span begin="01:37.063" end="01:37.350">I </span><span begin="01:37.350" end="01:37.598">can't </span><span begin="01:37.598" end="01:38.215">accept </span><span begin="01:38.215" end="01:38.398">that</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.790" end="01:40.201"><span begin="01:38.790" end="01:39.110">'Cause </span><span begin="01:39.110" end="01:39.389">you </span><span begin="01:39.389" end="01:39.733">won't </span><span begin="01:39.733" end="01:39.989">come </span><span begin="01:39.989" end="01:40.201">back</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.089" end="01:43.113"><span begin="01:41.089" end="01:41.482">Fortune </span><span begin="01:41.849" end="01:42.097">it </span><span begin="01:42.097" end="01:42.329">seems </span><span begin="01:42.329" end="01:42.713">so </span><span begin="01:42.713" end="01:43.113">easy</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.657" end="01:44.833"><span begin="01:43.657" end="01:43.897">But </span><span begin="01:43.897" end="01:44.297">it'